WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.477 --> 00:00:02.335
- Um, it's back!

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.321
- Star Wars is back!

00:00:04.321 --> 00:00:05.834
- Yeah, baby, yeah!

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:07.611
- Do you know how long
I've been waiting for this?

00:00:07.611 --> 00:00:09.955
I was practically raised on this film.

00:00:09.955 --> 00:00:12.498
- I know, it's like
welcoming back old friends.

00:00:12.498 --> 00:00:14.082
- And welcoming new ones to the family.

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:15.127
- The brunette.

00:00:15.127 --> 00:00:16.728
Dude, that chick, she's so hot.

00:00:16.728 --> 00:00:17.995
- Hella fine.

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:19.154
- And the trailer?

00:00:19.154 --> 00:00:20.362
- I cried.
- [Man in Plaid] You did?

00:00:20.362 --> 00:00:22.221
- That's how epic it was.

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.516
And those effects?
- Incredible.

00:00:24.516 --> 00:00:26.228
I mean, how long has it been since

00:00:26.228 --> 00:00:27.866
we've had a Star Wars film?

00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:29.202
- It's been at least a decade.

00:00:29.202 --> 00:00:31.793
- Wow, that was a long time ago.

00:00:31.793 --> 00:00:34.909
- [Both] In a galaxy far, far away!

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.886
("Star Wars Main Theme")
♫ Bohm, bohm

00:00:36.886 --> 00:00:38.396
♫ Bohm, bohm, bohm ♫

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.776
Sorry.

00:00:41.776 --> 00:00:44.340
Oh, god, we gotta roll if
we want front row seats.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.073
Okay, this film is gonna be the bomb.

00:00:47.073 --> 00:00:48.513
- There's no way they can screw this up.

00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:49.486
- [Man in Plaid] No, are you kidding me?

00:00:49.486 --> 00:00:51.566
(dramatic music)

00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:55.919
(heavy sobs)

00:00:55.919 --> 00:00:58.559
